Skate all night on the shortest night of the year!

For the second year running, join Sk8 Kind Street on the Summer Solstice Skate. Starting at Victoria Park (by the Tennis Courts), you'll meet the community and skate the night away.

Plenty of opportunities to rest, eat and drink.

You will love our roads and routes!

SK8 Kind Street
